A||||14||loafer87gt||New Sony headunit and other news!||||1||
Z||000000||loafer87gt||05-20-2000||05:53 PM||||Hey guys, I got my new stereo stuff for my Gt today. Sony has its new Xplode CD player lineup out and they look really sweet. They look like they are made for the Fiero, they have the same brushed steel coloring as the faceplates and the same amber redish/orange illumination. I also purchased some of the dynomat sound deading material and I am going to do my firewall and see if it will muffle some of the noise from my injectors and the leaking manifold. I also installed a top of the line Clifford alarm system with the optional pager service, and I ordered the optional radar addon so if someone sticks their hand in the car when you have the window down the alarm will sound. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||05-20-2000||07:21 PM||||Let me know how you like the Clifford security system. I'm in the market for one at the moment.<P>You know you just can't go wrong with a SONY !!! I've always liked thier stuff.||||reg||1
